{"reviewId": "254854030_87DHZLIfn", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 10, "content": "美国和欧洲当年搞工业化时世界还没形成高度细致的全球分工，它们自己从头做到尾既掌握核心技术又掌控市场和规则，基本是独立自主闭环式的工业化。而中国工业化是在第二次全球化浪潮全球分工已经非常成熟的环境下开始的，从一开始就嵌入到世界产业链里，是国际分工体系中的一个环节，不是从头到尾自己独立完成。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "不过在与经典工业化过程的对比中，我们也深知中国的工业化进程所处的世界经济体系与美国、欧洲等早期工业化国家的根本区别。", "range": "824-882", "chapterName": "05 走向成熟 中国经济即将V形反转", "chapterIdx": 10, "reviewId": "254854030_87DHZLIfn", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1773627663, "userEditTime": 1776352352, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "05 走向成熟 中国经济即将V形反转", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 14, "likes": [{"userVid": 378794714, "name": "Leslie", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEIyrkWSpPLCeKR7ibTmIDJbhic1LpaaE9wS0hWYbkZQATDBQo3gBHe52otwSPdwAvjcfphaMPSAUgibIerZaQKVKVv2hMbMfor8T2qw5Wh9SeVEg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "Leslie", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M5-0-100", "desc": "读完书籍", "title": "读完书籍", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 1, 